5,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"Let's begin. Since it's the first day, we have no information. I'll be observing everyone's reactions.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Kenji,,This is so exciting! I wonder who the werewolf is? I'll do my best to help the village!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,We should stay calm and logical. Let's see how everyone speaks before we jump to any conclusions.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. A cautious approach is best. I will be analyzing the flow of the conversation.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm going to find the werewolf with my super-detective skills!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,pass,Toshio,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Skip"",""raw"":""Skip.""}],""raw"":""Skip.""}"
11,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, you're so energetic! Let's work together to find the bad guy!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, your enthusiasm is great, but remember that the werewolf might try to blend in by acting friendly.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,Mizuki is correct. We must not let emotions cloud our judgment.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, I'll be careful! But I bet I can tell who's lying just by looking at them!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Toshio,,It seems we are all on the same page for now. I'll continue to watch.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm just so curious! Does anyone have any theories yet?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"It's too early for theories, Kenji. We need more data.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,Indeed. Let's use this time to establish a baseline for everyone's behavior.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Boring! I want to start guessing! But okay, I'll be a good girl and wait.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
