31,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"The first night has passed. If the Seer found something, they might be considering how to reveal it.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I hope the Seer found the werewolf! Did anyone find anything?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, if the Seer reveals themselves too early, the werewolf will just kill them tonight. It's better to be subtle.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Mizuki's logic is sound. However, the village needs a direction to avoid wasting a vote.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to know! Who looks the most suspicious? I think everyone looks a bit suspicious!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, you seem very composed. Do you have any thoughts on who we should scrutinize first?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"Yeah, Ryuji-san! You're always so smart, tell us what you think!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Let's look at the patterns. Toshio is very quiet, which could be a sign of a villager or a calculating werewolf.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I have identified the werewolf. To ensure the village wins, I believe it is time to be direct. Mizuki is the werewolf.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,Whoa! Ryuji-san just said it! Is it really Mizuki-san?,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"That was a bold claim. @Ryuji, are you claiming to be the Seer?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Kenji,,Really?! Mizuki-san? But she's been so helpful and logical!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Ryuji, that's a blatant lie. I am a villager. You're likely the werewolf trying to frame me to gain trust.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I am the Seer. My divination does not lie. Your attempt to flip the accusation is a typical werewolf tactic.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,This is getting intense! It's like a real movie! I believe Ryuji-san because he's usually so serious!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"If Ryuji is the Seer, the choice is clear. If he's the werewolf, we lose a villager. But his confidence is convincing.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I trust Ryuji-san! Sorry, Mizuki-san, but we have to follow the evidence!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,This is illogical. You're all being led by one person's word without proof. Please think this through.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,The proof is in the divination. I suggest we vote for Mizuki now.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm voting for Mizuki-san! Sorry!,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
